        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Nick Carter, Brady Seals, Avril Lavigne, Jordan Knight, Porter Howell, Dwayne O'Brien, Christy DiNapoli\n- Products: Now or Never, I'm Taking Off, All American, Nick & Knight, Play Time, Get Over Me, What Were You Thinkin'\n- Organizations: Backstreet Boys, Star City\n- Roles: singer, songwriter, actor, dancer, country music artist\n\nFacts:\n- Nick Carter was born on January 28, 1980, and he is an American singer, songwriter, actor, and dancer.\n- Brady Seals was born on March 29, 1969, and he is an American country music artist.\n- Brady Seals released his fourth solo album, Play Time, in 2009 via Star City.\n- As of 2015, Nick Carter had released the solo albums Now or Never, I'm Taking Off, and All American during breaks in Backstreet Boys schedules.\n- As of 2015, Nick Carter had also released a collaboration with Jordan Knight titled Nick & Knight.\n- Get Over Me is a song by American singer and songwriter Nick Carter featuring Canadian singer Avril Lavigne.\n- What Were You Thinkin' was written by Porter Howell, Dwayne O'Brien, Brady Seals, and Christy DiNapoli.",
